  "description": "This is a extension package for LiveMarkdown.Avalonia that adds support for rendering SVG.\n      Note that this package uses Svg.Controls.Skia.Avalonia for rendering SVG. If you want to use Svg.Controls.Avalonia instead, please install LiveMarkdown.Avalonia.Svg package.",
